      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第一帧，先看原来的吵闹问题。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 31.651,
      "end": 40.171,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "中文锚点是：我们家的狗 Rex 过去常坐在大门外面叫；每次想进花园，就一直叫到有人开门。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "start": 40.521,
      "end": 46.249,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文第一句是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Our dog, Rex, used to sit outside our front gate and bark"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "start": 46.598,
      "end": 52.854,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "注意这里是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "bark"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "，狗叫，不是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "dark"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "start": 53.204,
      "end": 58.86,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Front gate"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "不是公寓门，而是房子外面通向花园的小门。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "start": 59.21,
      "end": 66.478,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "反复习惯用两个词带出来："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "used to sit"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "he would bark"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "start": 66.827,
      "end": 73.587,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "课文接着说："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Every time he wanted to come into the garden he would bark until someone opened the gate"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "start": 73.937,
      "end": 80.369,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这里的"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "until"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "很重要：一直叫，叫到有人开门为止。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "start": 80.719,
      "end": 86.951,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "1"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "邻居不是坏人，他们只是受不了 noise："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "the neighbours complained of the noise"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
