      "start": 269.882,
      "end": 275.178,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "Rex 的反应是："
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Rex got so annoyed we have not seen him since"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "start": 275.528,
      "end": 280.688,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "这个结尾是漫画式的生气和消失，不是危险或悲伤。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "start": 281.038,
      "end": 289.278,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "retell",
      "scene_meta": {
        "frame": "4"
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "第四帧记住：Rex 把一个开门技巧玩成了“进来、出去、又进来”的叫门习惯。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "start": 289.628,
      "end": 294.368,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "老师，Rex 学会按门闩以后，训练算成功了吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "start": 294.718,
      "end": 299.078,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "算成功了。The trick worked. 它真的会自己开门了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "start": 299.428,
      "end": 302.506,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "那为什么家里还是头疼？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "start": 302.856,
      "end": 308.496,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "因为真正的目标不是“会开门”，而是"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "stop barking"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "start": 308.845,
      "end": 312.595,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "哦，办法解决了“进来”，却没有解决“一直叫”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "start": 312.945,
      "end": 316.945,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对。后来 Rex 还把这个办法变成了新的“出去问题”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 55,
      "start": 317.295,
      "end": 323.208,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Let himself in"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "和"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "let him out"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "怎么分？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 56,
      "start": 323.557,
      "end": 333.493,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Let himself in"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是 Rex 自己把自己放进来；"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "let him out"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "是别人把 Rex 放出去。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 57,
      "start": 333.843,
      "end": 340.186,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "所以标题"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "In or out?"
        },
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "就是在笑这个方向反复变？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 58,
      "start": 340.536,
      "end": 350.256,
      "speaker": "A",
      "scene": "discuss",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "对，这就是笑点：Rex 学会了一个小技巧，却把它变成了烦人的新习惯。"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "One trick became a new habit."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 59,
      "start": 350.606,
      "end": 354.854,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Our dog, Rex, used to sit outside our front gate and bark."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 60,
      "start": 355.204,
      "end": 360.34,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Every time he wanted to come into the garden he would bark until someone opened the gate."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 61,
      "start": 360.69,
      "end": 367.554,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "As the neighbours complained of the noise, my husband spent weeks training him to press his paw on the latch to let himself in."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 62,
      "start": 367.903,
      "end": 371.527,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Rex soon became an expert at opening the gate."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 63,
      "start": 371.877,
      "end": 377.277,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "However, when I was going out shopping last week, I noticed him in the garden near the gate."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 64,
      "start": 377.627,
      "end": 381.611,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "This time he was barking so that someone would let him out!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 65,
      "start": 381.961,
      "end": 385.681,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Since then, he has developed another bad habit."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 66,
      "start": 386.031,
      "end": 391.983,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "As soon as he opens the gate from the outside, he comes into the garden and waits until the gate shuts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 67,
      "start": 392.333,
      "end": 395.885,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Then he sits and barks until someone lets him out."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 68,
      "start": 396.235,
      "end": 400.843,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "After this he immediately lets himself in and begins barking again."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 69,
      "start": 401.192,
      "end": 406.424,
      "speaker": "B",
      "scene": "passage_normal",
      "scene_meta": {},
      "segments": [
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Yesterday my husband removed the gate and Rex got so annoyed we have not seen him since."
        }
      ]
    },
